\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0o kho b\u7841\'3fc.
\par 3/ T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc t\u7889\'3ft c\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\u7875\'3fm tra c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7863\'3fc nhi\u7879\'3fm \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f v\u7915\'3fa \'f0\u7849\'3fy m\u7841\'3fnh ch\u7889
\'3fng th\u7845\'3ft thu v\u7915\'3fa t\u7841\'3fo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi cho thi h\'e0nh lu\u7853\'3ft thu\u7871\'3f m\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7841\'3ft k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f t\u7889\'3ft. C\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\u7875\'3f
